:0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Neovim version (nvim -v)\n\n0.8.0\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nno, vim 9.0 (2022 Jun 28, compiled Oct 20 2022 00:00:00)\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nFedora Linux 36 (Workstation Edition)\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nGNOME Terminal 3.44.1 using VTE 0.68.0 +BIDI +GNUTLS +ICU +SYSTEMD\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-256color\n\n### Installation\n\nflatpak\n\n### How to reproduce the issue\n\nFrom a clean fedora image\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nwget \"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/download/v0.8.0/nvim-linux64.tar.gz\"\r\ntar xzvf nvim-linux64.tar.gz\r\n\r\nwget \"http://deb.debian.org/debian/pool/main/m/myspell-pt-br/myspell-pt-br_20131030.orig.tar.gz\"\r\ntar xzvf myspell-pt-br_20131030.orig.tar.gz\r\n\r\n./nvim-linux64/bin/nvim -c \"mkspell nvim-linux64/share/nvim/runtime/spell/pt myspell-pt-br-20131030/pt_BR\"\r\n./nvim-linux64/bin/nvim -c \"set spelllang=pt | set spell\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Type anything wrong\r\n- Press `z=`\r\n- Neovim is frozen\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nGet a list of suggestions\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nNeovim freezes.\r\n\r\nAlso tested on version 0.7.2, it works but is a bit slow.","closed_by":{"login":"zeertzjq","id":35768171,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY4MTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35768171?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq","html_url":"https://github.com/zeertzjq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/events